<p>An insurance claim is supposed to help you recover after property damage. Too often it turns into weeks of phone tag, requests for more documents, and an estimate that does not come close to what a contractor says the repair will cost. Dallas Public Adjuster gives homeowners and business owners in Dallas, Dallas County, and nearby North Texas cities a licensed professional on their side of that process: a public adjuster who works only for the policyholder.</p>
<p>After a spring hailstorm or a hard freeze, your insurance company sends its own adjuster, and often a reviewer and an estimator behind them. Their job is to evaluate the claim for the insurer. Ours is to make sure your loss is documented fully and presented accurately under the policy you paid for.</p>

