<p>Dallas Public Adjuster is a public adjusting service of <strong>[[company]]</strong>, licensed by the Texas Department of Insurance (TDI license #[[license]]). We do not keep a storefront office. We serve Dallas, Dallas County, and surrounding North Texas communities by meeting clients at the damaged property, where the claim actually starts.</p>

